# Run artefacts are the evidence for the published numbers, so
# reports/runs/ is committed. Scratch and debug runs are not.
# Note the trailing /* rather than /: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is itself excluded, so the negation below would be
# dead if this line ignored the directory.
reports/tmp/*
!reports/tmp/.gitkeep

NOTES.md
